---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---
<Layout
  title="About Us | Hanfu Dress Guide"
  description="About the Hanfu Dress Guide: who we are, why we built the most complete English-language resource for traditional Chinese Hanfu dresses, and what we stand for."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.dresses-hanfu.com/about/"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "About", url: "/about" }]}
  articleSchema={{
    datePublished: "2026-08-08",
    dateModified: "2026-08-08",
    author: { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Hanfu Dress Guide" }
  }}
>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main>
    <article>
      <section class="section" style="padding-bottom: 2rem;">
        <div class="container-narrow">
          <p style="font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-muted);margin-bottom:1rem;"><a href="/" style="color:var(--color-accent);">Home</a> &rsaquo; About</p>
          <h1>About Hanfu Dress Guide</h1>
          <p class="lead" style="font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--color-muted);margin-top:1.5rem;line-height:1.55;">
            We started Hanfu Dress Guide because quality Hanfu information was scattered across brand Instagram pages, Chinese forum threads, and TikTok videos — in fragments and often self-serving. We wanted one honest, complete, easy-to-use English resource.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
        <div class="container-narrow">

          <h2>What We Cover</h2>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.0625rem;margin-top:1rem;">Style &amp; dynasty guides</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--color-muted);font-size:0.9375rem;line-height:1.7;">Tang, Song, Ming, modern: the silhouettes, cultural context, and how to wear each correctly.</p>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.0625rem;margin-top:1.5rem;">Practical how-tos</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--color-muted);font-size:0.9375rem;line-height:1.7;">Hairstyles, fabric care, sizing across cross-collar and ru combinations, and etiquette.</p>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.0625rem;margin-top:1.5rem;">Responsible buying</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--color-muted);font-size:0.9375rem;line-height:1.7;">Where to buy, what authentic really means, per-price expectations, and the shops worth your money.</p>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.0625rem;margin-top:1.5rem;">Comparisons</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--color-muted);font-size:0.9375rem;line-height:1.7;">Hanfu vs kimono, hanbok, qipao, and cheongsam: the honest differences, plainly explained.</p>

          <h2 style="margin-top:3rem;">Our Principles</h2>
          <div class="vs-card" style="margin-top:1rem;padding:1.75rem;">
            <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--color-muted);font-size:0.9375rem;line-height:1.8;margin:0;">
              <li><strong>Cultural accuracy first.</strong> We double-check dynasty facts, collar techniques, and fabric names — and correct errors openly when we're wrong.</li>
              <li><strong>No paid promotion.</strong> We don't accept payment for listings or drop tags from brands we independently believe in.</li>
              <li><strong>Good for beginners.</strong> A person wearing their first Hanfu should feel welcome, not overwhelmed by details.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <h2 style="margin-top:3rem;">Contact</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Questions, corrections, or partnerships? Email us via the <a href="/legal/contact/" style="color:var(--color-accent);">contact page</a>, or sign up for <a href="/newsletter/" style="color:var(--color-accent);">the newsletter</a> to follow along.
          </p>

          <div style="margin-top:3rem;padding:2rem;background:var(--color-accent-light);border-radius:var(--radius-md);">
            <p style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;font-family:var(--font-display);">Explore the Guide</p>
            <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.75rem;margin-top:1rem;">
              <a href="/guides/" class="btn btn-outline">All Guides</a>
              <a href="/buying/" class="btn btn-outline">Buying Hanfu</a>
              <a href="/comparisons/" class="btn btn-outline">Comparisons</a>
              <a href="/styles/song/" class="btn btn-outline">Song Style</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter newsletter={false} />
</Layout>